I am on the Wizard level, trying to get the amulet.  The Wizard in both
human (@) and demon (&) form has got me surrounded.  Each time I get hit, I
lose about 10 hps.  When I am able to hurt the Wizard enough, he flys away
to regenerate.  So, basically, I've died six or seven different ways.  I
like to hear about different ways of handling the Wizard.

Currently, I have a save-file where a level 14 Valkyrie with 107/135 hp and
AC -13 on dungeon level 35.  Stats are St:18/97 Dx:11 Co:18 In:8 Wi:10 Ch:7.
Weapon is blessed +2 Excal.; Stormy is available but useless against the
Wiz.  I have most intrinsics, and have found that teleporting to a blind
alley will limit my opponent to one-at-a-time.  But, even when I killed the
human Wizard (who has the AoY), the demon Wizard flys in before I could
grab the amulet and do the paralysis potion trick.

Henry


